  rigSignature: 415899A36E5F36473438AE1BC4FE6EC914F96F9E5C882A7651388F4C7C395EF5
  description: 'Full sequence: stand upright at frames 0-30, lean toward the right
    wall through frame 120 and settle. Reach the left hand to the left trouser pocket
    at frame 180, grasp at frame 210, draw the phone clear by frame 240 and bring
    the screen to chest height by frame 270. Lower the gaze and use the right index
    finger to tap and scroll while the left hand supports the phone through frame
    540. Withdraw the right hand, lower the phone, guide it back into the same left
    trouser pocket at frames 630-660, release it and return the left arm to the side
    by frame 690. Leave the wall through frames 720-840, returning the heel to the
    floor, then hold the original upright stance through frame 900. 60 FPS with keys
    every 30 frames. First and last poses match exactly. The preview scene supplies
    a phone prop synchronized with the left hand and pocket events. Refinement: the
    right leg is the nearly straight weight-bearing support (about 6 degrees of knee
    flexion) throughout the supported lean. Both feet keep their authored contact
    positions; the relaxed left knee and raised heel are retained.'
  sourceRig: {fileID: 1648686333044378150, guid: 9d1a15a96145a924e838aae19388632a, type: 3}
